From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 22:48:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] extensions: make the toolbar button opt-in

The button consumes scarce toolbar space. Keep it opt-in.
---
 .../ExtensionsToolbarCoordinatorImpl.java     | 42 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../shared_preferences/SharedPrefsUtils.java  |  5 ++-
 .../java/res/xml/privacy_preferences_ext.xml  |  5 +++
 .../privacy/settings/PrivacySettingsExt.java  | 20 +++++++++
 .../strings/android_chrome_ext_strings.grdp   |  6 +++
 5 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/android/toolbar/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/toolbar/extensions/ExtensionsToolbarCoordinatorImpl.java b/chrome/browser/ui/android/toolbar/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/toolbar/extensions/ExtensionsToolbarCoordinatorImpl.java
